  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG Tertiary Education Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objectives are: 1) to improve the regulatory environment for tertiary education management, governance and quality assurance; 2) increase internal and external efficiency of the tertiary education system, as a first step towards achieving sustainability; and 3) to create incentives and provide the basis for improvements in efficiency, quality and relevance of tertiary education institutions in order to meet the socioeconomic needs of the Palestinian population.</narrative>
  </description>
